        {
          "page": 2,
          "method": "real_source_excerpt",
          "text": "Capacity 256GB/512GB/1TB/2TB. PCIe Gen 4 16Gb/s interface with up to 4 lanes. Compliant with NVMe Revision 2.0. Supporting host memory buffer. Supporting PLP (Optional). TBW: 256GB 768TB; 512GB 1500TB; 1TB 3000TB; 2TB 6000TB. WAF=1. Operating: A97M8-Y/A97M8-PY -40°C~+85°C; K97M8-Y/K97M8-PY -25°C~+85°C; S97M8-Y/S97M8-PY -10°C~+70°C."
        },
        {
          "page": 5,
          "method": "real_source_excerpt",
          "text": "Industrial SSDs use NAND Flash Memory. It supports the PCIe 4.0 interface standard with up to four lanes."
